{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on question a31c4052 (J3 follow-up 25b40ad2, claim-size wording).\n\nThe signed reason is `claim-too-large`. Add it to ERRORS in\npackages/checkers/src/outcome.ts as a package word, beside\n`runner-not-started` and `limits-passed`, which the package already names\non its own. An oversize claim ends the job as `check-error` with reason\n`claim-too-large`, no execution and no run record. The log event on the\n`find` and `run` steps is `claim-too-large`. `run-lost` is not used for\nthis case; it stays the word for a run that started or was recorded and\ncannot be judged.\n\nThis amends point 2 and witness (c) of 25b40ad2 together: witness (c)\nshows an oversize claim ends `check-error` with reason `claim-too-large`,\nexecutes nothing and writes no record. No second cause field.\n\nNote for the request's bases: 25b40ad2 rests on the retired filing\nrequest 24611586, so it reads stale. A stale base does not block\n(planner 824623ad); rest the artifacts and the review request on\n25b40ad2 and this ruling.\n\nRetire this question when you have read the ruling.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:25b40ad251821674f8ceeecef0f2ed219269c466, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:a31c40528545255ad179820a294c91a79492a303 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:078677f7c97c7052720a0bf2e87a7e630cf9ea37, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:142b31aaeb07e4c21eca1fb98f03d490ad179e26, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1cbd62abee295399b0df9abf3b484b8e4394082c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:2112c1c1f40adc7b7ab355b14b1f684c2dd29454 and 28 more","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}